rketing (from 01/01/2018)&quot; THEN &apos;P61381 - Vendor Branding&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61380100; Other Campaign costs&quot; THEN &apos;P61376 - Partner/Co-operations&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61310200; Out of Home (outdoor)&quot; THEN &apos;P61373 - Out of Home (outdoor)&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61361300; Restaurant marketing (from 01/01/2018)&quot; THEN &apos;P61388 - Other Campaign Costs&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;60008300; Rider Equipment - Advertising&quot; THEN &apos;P61370 - Rider Equipment - Advertising&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61361700; Online Branding&quot; THEN &apos;P61382 - Online Branding&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61368000; Other Marketing&quot; THEN &apos;P61368 - Other Marketing&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61360400; Public Relation&quot; THEN &apos;P61380 - Public Relation&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;60008100; Sales related Marketing Expenses&quot; THEN &apos;P61614 - Sales related Marketing Expenses&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;Creative Production; 61300100 TV production cost&quot; THEN &apos;P61360 - Creative Production&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61330500; Influencers Marketing&quot; THEN &apos;P61377 - Influencers Marketing&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;Creative Production; 61300100 TV production cost&quot; THEN &apos;P61360 - Creative Production&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61300000; TV advertising cost&quot; THEN &apos;P61371 - TV advertising cost&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61310000; Radio&quot; THEN &apos;P61372 - Radio&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61360300; Sponsorship&quot; THEN &apos;P61362 - Sponsorship&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61368100; Vendor Packaging&quot; THEN &apos;P61383 - Vendor Packaging&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61330500; Influencers Marketing&quot; THEN &apos;P61377 - Influencers Marketing&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61300100; TV production cost&quot; THEN &apos;P61360 - Creative Production&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61300100; TV production cost&quot; THEN &apos;P61360 - Creative Production&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61300100; TV production cost&quot; THEN &apos;P61360 - Creative Production&apos;&#13;&#10;ELSEIF [gl_code] + &apos;; &apos; + [gl_acc_name] = &quot;61361700; Online Branding&quot; THEN &apos;P61382 - Online Branding&apos;&#13;&#10;else &quot;Not Found&quot;&#13;&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Costs (1)' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_1620029292577099777 1]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Parameter 4 2]&#10;WHEN &apos;EUR&apos; THEN IFNULL([costs_fp_eur]*[marketing_share],0)&#10;ELSE IFNULL([costs_fp_lc]*[marketing_share],0)&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Budget' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_1620029292626370563]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Parameter 4 1]&#10;WHEN &apos;EUR&apos; THEN IFNULL([budget_eur],0)&#10;ELSE NULL&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Runrate (1)' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_1620029292629925895 1]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Parameter 4 2]&#10;WHEN &apos;EUR&apos; THEN IFNULL([runrate_fp_eur] * [marketing_share],0)&#10;ELSE IFNULL([runrate_fp_lc] * [marketing_share],0)&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Runrate' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_1620029292629925895]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Currency 4 (copy)_3232669771013398529]&#10;WHEN &apos;EUR&apos; THEN [runrate_fp_eur]&#10;ELSE IFNULL([runrate_fp_lc],0)&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Costs Vouchers' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_1620029292634591243]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF [cost_source] = &apos;Vouchers&apos; THEN [Calculation_3457849764096270336] ELSE 0 END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Finance Discount Cost Filter' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_2021764438180106240]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='( [Calculation_3457849764102094854] + [Calculation_3457849764102258695] + [Calculation_3457849764102320136] ) &gt; 0.01' />
      </column>
      <column caption='fin_filter_future_months' datatype='boolean' name='[Calculation_3160189974078246912]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='// Data is showing months in the future. E.g. Its Jan&apos;24 now, but dashboard shows months till Dec&apos;24.&#10;// Reason is because of a full join with budget table from marketing, where the budget is available for the whole year.&#10;// This calculated field is to remove these month as its not applicable to finance as of now.&#10;&#10;[month] &lt;= DATETRUNC(&apos;month&apos;,DATE(NOW()))' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Actuals Toggle' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_3232669771013201920]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Currency 4 (copy)_3232669771013398529]&#10;WHEN &apos;EUR&apos; THEN IFNULL([costs_fp_eur]*[marketing_share],0)&#10;WHEN &apos;LC&apos; THEN IFNULL([costs_fp_lc]*[marketing_share],0)&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Costs' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_3457849764096270336]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Parameter 1]&#10;WHEN &apos;Euro&apos; THEN IFNULL([costs_fp_eur]*[marketing_share],0)&#10;ELSE IFNULL([costs_fp_lc]*[marketing_share],0)&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Costs (Vendor)' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_3457849764096528385]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE TRUE&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Currency 4 (copy)_3232669771013398529] = &apos;EUR&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [costs_vendor_eur]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Currency 4 (copy)_3232669771013398529] = &apos;EUR&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [costs_vendor_eur]&#10;&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Currency 4 (copy)_3232669771013398529] != &apos;EUR&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [costs_vendor_lc]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Currency 4 (copy)_3232669771013398529] != &apos;EUR&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [costs_vendor_lc]&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Rev. Reduction' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_3457849764096868354]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Currency 4 (copy)_3232669771013398529]&#10;WHEN &apos;EUR&apos; THEN IFNULL([revenue_reduction_plus_vat_eur],0)&#10;ELSE IFNULL([revenue_reduction_plus_vat_local], 0)&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Run Rate' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_3457849764097024003]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [Parameters].[Currency 4 (copy)_3232669771013398529]&#10;WHEN &apos;EUR&apos; THEN IFNULL([runrate_fp_eur] * [marketing_share],0)&#10;ELSE IFNULL([runrate_fp_lc] * [marketing_share],0)&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Ratio' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_3457849764097105924]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='SUM([Calculation_3457849764096270336]) / SUM([Calculation_3457849764096270336]+[Calculation_3457849764096528385])' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Rev. Reduction Share' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_3457849764097200133]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='ZN(SUM([Calculation_3457849764096868354])/(SUM([Calculation_3457849764096868354])+SUM([Calculation_3457849764096270336])))' />
      </column>
      <column caption='CARC' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_3457849764102094854]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE TRUE&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] = &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [carc_plus_vat_eur]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] = &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [carc_eur]&#10;&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] != &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [carc_plus_vat_local]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] != &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [carc_local]&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Revenue Reduction' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_3457849764102258695]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE TRUE&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] = &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [revenue_reduction_plus_vat_eur]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] = &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [revenue_reduction_eur]&#10;&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] != &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [revenue_reduction_plus_vat_local]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] != &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [revenue_reduction_local]&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Del. Non Personnel Cost' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_3457849764102320136]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE TRUE&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] = &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [del_non_personnel_cost_plus_vat_eur]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] = &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [del_non_personnel_cost_eur]&#10;&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] != &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [del_non_personnel_cost_plus_vat_local]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] != &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [del_non_personnel_cost_local]&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Costs (Ticket)' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_3457849764105162761]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE TRUE&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] = &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [costs_ticket_eur]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] = &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [costs_ticket_eur]&#10;&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] != &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [costs_ticket_lc]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] != &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [costs_ticket_lc]&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Costs (Accumulated)' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_3457849764105326602]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE TRUE&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] = &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [costs_remaining_eur]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] = &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [costs_remaining_eur]&#10;&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] != &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [costs_remaining_lc]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] != &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [costs_remaining_lc]&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Costs (Remaining)' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_3457849764105625611]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE TRUE&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] = &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [costs_remaining_eur]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] = &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;    THEN [costs_remaining_eur]&#10;&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] != &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) = &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [costs_remaining_lc]&#10;  WHEN [Parameters].[Parameter 1] != &apos;Euro&apos; AND LOWER([Parameters].[Parameter 5]) != &apos;vat_included&apos;&#10;     THEN [costs_remaining_lc]&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='View' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_4192710559887515648]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='[Parameters].[Parameter 2]' />
      </column>
      <column caption='GL Account' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_4192710561699475457]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF [Month]&lt;=DATE(&quot;2024-12-31&quot;)&#10;then [gl_code] + &quot; &quot; + [gl_acc_name]&#10;else [gl_code] end' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Costs vs Budget' datatype='real' name='[Calculation_4417468290157133826]' role='measure' type='quantitative'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='SUM([Calculation_3457849764096270336]) - SUM([budget_eur])' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Vertical Overall' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_4466233884779438080]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='CASE [cost_source]&#10;WHEN &apos;Vouchers&apos; THEN [vertical_per_origin]&#10;ELSE [vertical_per_redemption]&#10;END' />
      </column>
      <column caption='Expand Cost Types' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_4714705867320053760]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='[Parameters].[Parameter 6]' />
      </column>
      <column caption='SAP GL Account' datatype='string' name='[Calculation_5789025525321592935]' role='dimension' type='nominal'>
        <calculation class='tableau' formula='IF [Calculation_4192710561699475457] = &apos;P70020 - Delivery Service - end customer fees (PF_KIT)&apos; and [cost_source] = &quot;Discounts&quot; THEN &apos;70020200 Delivery Service - end customer fees - Kitchens and Concept&apos;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_4192710561699475457] = &apos;P70020 - Delivery Service - end customer fees (PF_QCD)&apos; and [cost_source] = &quot;Discounts&quot; THEN &apos;70020300 Delivery Services - Dark Store&apos;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_4192710561699475457] = &apos;P70020 - Delivery Service - end customer fees (PF_QCL)&apos; and [cost_source] = &quot;Discounts&quot;  THEN &apos;70020400 Delivery service - Groceries&apos;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_4192710561699475457] = &apos;P70020 - Delivery Service - end customer fees&apos; and [cost_source] = &quot;Discounts&quot;  THEN &apos;70020000 Delivery Service - end customer fees&apos;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_4192710561699475457] = &apos;P61347 - Subscriptions Specific Incentives&apos; and [cost_source] = &quot;Discounts&quot; THEN &apos;61380500 Subscription Specific Incentives&apos;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_4192710561699475457] = &apos;P70012 - Commission revenues - user subsidies and incentives&apos; and [cost_source] = &quot;Discounts&quot; THEN &apos;70012100 User sub pick up inc&apos;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_4192710561699475457] = &apos;P70580 - Other revenues - reductions&apos; and [cost_source] = &quot;Discounts&quot; THEN &apos;70901800 Online Food Ordering - Other reduction of revenue&apos;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_4192710561699475457] = &apos;P61314 - DH funded Discounts - Acquisition&apos; and [cost_source] = &quot;Discounts&quot; THEN &apos;61341500 DH funded Discounts - Acquisition&apos;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_4192710561699475457] = &apos;P61344 - DH funded Discounts - Retention&apos; and [cost_source] = &quot;Discounts&quot; THEN &apos;61341300 DH funded Discounts - Retention&apos;&#10;&#10;ELSEIF [Calculation_4192710561699475457] = &a